ies to test your driving skills and see if you can keep your cargo safe.Major Optimization ImprovementsWe've put a lot of work into optimizing the game to make the gameplay smoother and more enjoyable.New Main MenuThe m","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-13T19:17:55Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067945120","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:04:52Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4872470-1840310314351860","game_id":"steam-4872470","kind":"announcement","title":"The Short Fuse Demo is Available Now!","summary":"In the demo you'll experience the core gameplay of delivering dangerous cargo through challenging environments. Choose the right vehicle, cross unstable bridges, survive sandstorms, avoid rockfalls, and find alternate routes when the road collapses beneath you.This is only the beginning. The full game will include:More vehiclesNew environments and hazardsOnline co-opMore delivery routes and challengesI'd love to hear your feedback after playing. Every comment helps improve the game before releas","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-10T15:47:03Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314351860","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:04:52Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4872470":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:53:25Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:53:24Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4872470":"2026-10-26T14:53:25Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4872470":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:53:24Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T14:53:24Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:53:24Z"},"5043050":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:53:25Z","last_success_at":"202